# WF

- Commands: `/wf-setup` → … → `/wf-verify-work` → `/wf-ship` ; hors loop: `/wf-audit-tests`, `/wf-file-bug`
- Tickets: `.wf/tickets/` + `wflow ticket …` ; bugs → ticket obligatoire (`shared-tickets.md`)
- Roles live in **`.wf/roles/`** (… + shared-design-system). **Frontend = design system only** (PROJECT § Design system)
- Code and folders must stay **human-navigable** — follow PROJECT § Codebase layout + shared-maintainability
- Replies: **short and direct** — see `.wf/roles/shared-communication.md`
- CLI: `wflow status` | `wflow board` | `wflow integrity` | `wflow sync` | `wflow next` | `wflow set-status`
- After changing phase status or todos: run **`wflow sync`** and **`wflow integrity`**
- Do **not** use GSD (`/gsd-*`, `.planning/`) on WF projects
- Execute reads **one phase file** only; Contract blocks are copied verbatim
